  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/08/24/coinbase-debuts-tokenized-stocks-on-base-network-joining-race-to-bring-equities-on-blockchain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Coinbase debuts tokenized stocks on Base network, joining race to bring equities on blockchain</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/08/24/standard-chartered-first-bank-to-distribute-anchorpoint-s-hong-kong-dollar-stablecoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Standard Chartered becomes first bank to distribute Hong Kong dollar stablecoin</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/first-bear-market-trend-line-reclaim-since-2025-five-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">First bear-market trend line reclaim since 2025: Five things to know in Bitcoin this week</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
